    <string name="main_text_73">Codex: existing experience. OpenCode: install opencode and complete auth login on the PC; opencode serve starts on first connection. DSH: configure model credentials on the PC. CC: install and sign in to claude on the PC. Sessions are isolated by runtime; tool permissions follow each CLI and approvals are not bypassed.</string>
